{"title":"Pentacontakaidigon","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>pentacontakaidigon</b> is a polygon with 52 sides. It is also sometimes written as <b>pentacontadigon</b> or  <b>pentecontadigon</b>. The sum of its interior angles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/751174613b908132d5961fcb8a4ab4c7cd34e3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9000^{\\circ}$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pentacontakaidigon&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polygon\" title=\"Polygon\">Polygon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Pentacontakaidigon&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018102842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 295/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.922      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.922      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9258:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018102842 and revision id 200879. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->